    "detailed_description": "You wake up, get dressed, shower, down your morning cup of coffee in two scalding gulps, and button on your coat. With that, you are off to catch the bus to work at your monotonous job. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou arrive and sit at your desk, hammering away at your keyboard in hour after hour of forced solitude. <br />\r\nIt is nearly the end of the year, and you can't help but think to yourself that there must be more to life than this.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&quot;It's a bit of a &quot;walking simulator&quot; but it's a quick little game that is really better described as an &quot;experience&quot; than a game, and deals with some pretty heavy subject matter for how simplistic it is.&quot;",
